{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55902","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十九 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙门莫苦远只桓，身四威仪且自观。\n蓬若出麻终不直，僧离清衆太无端。\n从前上古诸先德，尽向丛林里获安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}